{
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "h1",
   "text": "Every second, about four babies are born somewhere on Earth.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.8,
   "end": 3.8,
   "section": "L1 COLD OPEN",
   "rate": 158
  },
  {
   "id": "h2",
   "text": "Now imagine you, and everyone alive, born on the same morning.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 3.92,
   "dur": 4.18,
   "end": 8.09,
   "section": "L1 COLD OPEN",
   "rate": 158
  },
  {
   "id": "h3",
   "text": "Same day as you. Same year as you.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 8.21,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "end": 11.25,
   "section": "L1 COLD OPEN",
   "rate": 158
  },
  {
   "id": "h4",
   "text": "Eight billion newborns crying at once. The planet smells of warm milk.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 11.37,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "end": 15.93,
   "section": "L1 COLD OPEN",
   "rate": 158
  },
  {
   "id": "h5",
   "text": "Not quite everyone, though: two billion borrowed adults are here to hold you.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 16.05,
   "dur": 4.94,
   "end": 20.99,
   "section": "L1 COLD OPEN",
   "rate": 158
  },
  {
   "id": "h6",
   "text": "On day one, each adult gets four of you.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 21.11,
   "dur": 3.42,
   "end": 24.52,
   "section": "L1 COLD OPEN",
   "rate": 158
  },
  {
   "id": "h7",
   "text": "At six, your class has ninety kids.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 24.64,
   "dur": 2.66,
   "end": 27.3,
   "section": "L1 COLD OPEN",
   "rate": 158
  },
  {
   "id": "h8",
   "text": "At sixty-five, you and the whole human race retire on one Monday.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 27.42,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "end": 31.98,
   "section": "L1 COLD OPEN",
   "rate": 158
  },
  {
   "id": "h9",
   "text": "And one of you will get a birthday none of the other eight billion ever had.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 32.1,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "end": 38.18,
   "section": "L1 COLD OPEN",
   "rate": 158
  },
  {
   "id": "r1",
   "text": "The rules. No clones. No time machine. Same planet, same cities.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 43.6,
   "dur": 4.18,
   "end": 47.77,
   "section": "L2 TITLE CARD + RULES",
   "rate": 158
  },
  {
   "id": "r2",
   "text": "One change: everyone alive shares your birthday, right down to the year.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 47.89,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "end": 52.45,
   "section": "L2 TITLE CARD + RULES",
   "rate": 158
  },
  {
   "id": "r3",
   "text": "To keep you alive, two billion adults are on loan from the old world: one per four babies.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 52.57,
   "dur": 6.84,
   "end": 59.4,
   "section": "L2 TITLE CARD + RULES",
   "rate": 158
  },
  {
   "id": "r4",
   "text": "They raise you. Then, on your thirtieth birthday, they hand everything over and step out of the story.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 59.52,
   "dur": 6.84,
   "end": 66.36,
   "section": "L2 TITLE CARD + RULES",
   "rate": 158
  },
  {
   "id": "r5",
   "text": "Keep that date in mind.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 66.48,
   "dur": 1.9,
   "end": 68.38,
   "section": "L2 TITLE CARD + RULES",
   "rate": 158
  },
  {
   "id": "r6",
   "text": "Happy birthday, everyone.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 68.5,
   "dur": 1.14,
   "end": 69.64,
   "section": "L2 TITLE CARD + RULES",
   "rate": 158
  },
  {
   "id": "d1",
   "text": "Day one.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 70.06,
   "dur": 0.73,
   "end": 70.79,
   "section": "L3 DAY 1",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "d2",
   "text": "Normally, the world handles about three hundred and sixty thousand births a day.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 70.91,
   "dur": 4.76,
   "end": 75.67,
   "section": "L3 DAY 1",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "d3",
   "text": "Today, you're sixty years' worth before lunch.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 75.79,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "end": 78.35,
   "section": "L3 DAY 1",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "d4",
   "text": "That's the first promise: every adult on Earth has four newborns, and newborns feed every few hours, all night.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 78.47,
   "dur": 6.95,
   "end": 85.42,
   "section": "L3 DAY 1",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "d5",
   "text": "That's around forty feeds and forty diaper changes, per adult, per day.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 85.54,
   "dur": 4.39,
   "end": 89.93,
   "section": "L3 DAY 1",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "d6",
   "text": "Here's the problem: who's running the power stations? The farms? The hospitals?",
   "os": null,
   "start": 90.05,
   "dur": 4.39,
   "end": 94.44,
   "section": "L3 DAY 1",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "d7",
   "text": "Yesterday, three and a half billion people had jobs. Today, there are two billion adults, all of them up at night with you.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 94.56,
   "dur": 8.41,
   "end": 102.97,
   "section": "L3 DAY 1",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "d8",
   "text": "Fine. We'll be kind: the lights stay on, and nobody goes hungry.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 103.09,
   "dur": 4.39,
   "end": 107.48,
   "section": "L3 DAY 1",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "d9",
   "text": "But nobody on Earth sleeps for about a year.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 107.6,
   "dur": 3.29,
   "end": 110.9,
   "section": "L3 DAY 1",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "y1a",
   "text": "Then it gets lovely.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 111.32,
   "dur": 1.5,
   "end": 112.82,
   "section": "L4 YEARS 1-5",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "y1b",
   "text": "Over a few months, the whole species learns to walk, clinging to somebody's hand.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 112.94,
   "dur": 5.25,
   "end": 118.19,
   "section": "L4 YEARS 1-5",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "y1c",
   "text": "Your birthday is a planet-wide holiday. Somewhere, a bakery gets an order for eight billion cakes.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 118.31,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "end": 124.31,
   "section": "L4 YEARS 1-5",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "y1d",
   "text": "Nobody is the baby of the family. Nobody is ever too old for the swings.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 124.43,
   "dur": 5.62,
   "end": 130.05,
   "section": "L4 YEARS 1-5",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "y1e",
   "text": "It's the fairest world there's ever been. Until you turn six.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 130.17,
   "dur": 4.12,
   "end": 134.3,
   "section": "L4 YEARS 1-5",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "y6a",
   "text": "Year six.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 134.72,
   "dur": 0.73,
   "end": 135.45,
   "section": "L5 YEAR 6",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "y6b",
   "text": "The first day of school is one Monday, for everybody.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 135.57,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "end": 139.23,
   "section": "L5 YEAR 6",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "y6c",
   "text": "Here's the problem: Earth has fewer than a hundred million teachers, so your class has about ninety kids in it. Today's average is twenty-three.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 139.35,
   "dur": 8.78,
   "end": 148.13,
   "section": "L5 YEAR 6",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "y6d",
   "text": "Sound impossible? One country already ran a small version.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 148.25,
   "dur": 3.29,
   "end": 151.54,
   "section": "L5 YEAR 6",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "y6e",
   "text": "In nineteen sixty-six, Romania banned abortion almost overnight, and the next year, births nearly doubled.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 151.66,
   "dur": 5.49,
   "end": 157.15,
   "section": "L5 YEAR 6",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "y6f",
   "text": "That one bulge jammed maternity wards, then classrooms, then university entrance, for twenty years.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 157.27,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "end": 162.39,
   "section": "L5 YEAR 6",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "y6g",
   "text": "Romania doubled one year. You're sixty years in a single morning.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 162.51,
   "dur": 4.02,
   "end": 166.53,
   "section": "L5 YEAR 6",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "y6h",
   "text": "Your year-group photo has to be taken from orbit.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 166.65,
   "dur": 3.29,
   "end": 169.95,
   "section": "L5 YEAR 6",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "y18a",
   "text": "Year eighteen.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 170.37,
   "dur": 0.72,
   "end": 171.09,
   "section": "L6 YEAR 18",
   "rate": 166
  },
  {
   "id": "y18b",
   "text": "Everyone on Earth finishes school on the same day.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 171.21,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "end": 174.46,
   "section": "L6 YEAR 18",
   "rate": 166
  },
  {
   "id": "y18c",
   "text": "The world has a quarter of a billion university places, about one per thirty-two of you, and three and a half billion jobs, with the old world sitting in most of them.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 174.58,
   "dur": 11.57,
   "end": 186.15,
   "section": "L6 YEAR 18",
   "rate": 166
  },
  {
   "id": "y18e",
   "text": "In twenty thirteen, more than half of young Spaniards looking for work couldn't find any. They called it a crisis.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 186.27,
   "dur": 7.23,
   "end": 193.5,
   "section": "L6 YEAR 18",
   "rate": 166
  },
  {
   "id": "y18f",
   "text": "For you, it's the whole planet.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 193.62,
   "dur": 2.17,
   "end": 195.79,
   "section": "L6 YEAR 18",
   "rate": 166
  },
  {
   "id": "y18g",
   "text": "Dating is easy, though. Everyone is exactly your age.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 195.91,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "end": 199.16,
   "section": "L6 YEAR 18",
   "rate": 166
  },
  {
   "id": "y18h",
   "text": "Which is why, a few years later, you all have kids. At once.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 199.28,
   "dur": 4.7,
   "end": 203.98,
   "section": "L6 YEAR 18",
   "rate": 166
  },
  {
   "id": "e1",
   "text": "Year twenty-four.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 204.4,
   "dur": 0.73,
   "end": 205.13,
   "section": "L6b YEAR 24, THE ECHO",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "e2",
   "text": "At a bit over two children per woman, a second wave rolls in: about eight billion babies, most of them inside twenty years.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 205.25,
   "dur": 8.41,
   "end": 213.66,
   "section": "L6b YEAR 24, THE ECHO",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "e3",
   "text": "Demographers would call your kids an echo.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 213.78,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "end": 216.35,
   "section": "L6b YEAR 24, THE ECHO",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "e4",
   "text": "Japan has one: a boom after the Second World War, then a smaller one in the early seventies, when those babies had babies.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 216.47,
   "dur": 8.41,
   "end": 224.88,
   "section": "L6b YEAR 24, THE ECHO",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "e5",
   "text": "Yours is the loudest echo in history.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 225.0,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "end": 227.56,
   "section": "L6b YEAR 24, THE ECHO",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "m1",
   "text": "But exams and jobs turn out to be the easy part.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 228.78,
   "dur": 4.23,
   "end": 233.01,
   "section": "L7 YEAR 30, MIDPOINT RUG PULL",
   "rate": 156
  },
  {
   "id": "m2",
   "text": "Year thirty. The date from the rules.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 233.13,
   "dur": 2.69,
   "end": 235.82,
   "section": "L7 YEAR 30, MIDPOINT RUG PULL",
   "rate": 156
  },
  {
   "id": "m3",
   "text": "On your thirtieth birthday, two billion adults hand over the keys and step out. All at once.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 235.94,
   "dur": 6.54,
   "end": 242.48,
   "section": "L7 YEAR 30, MIDPOINT RUG PULL",
   "rate": 156
  },
  {
   "id": "m4",
   "text": "Look at the chart. Nobody on Earth is older than you.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 242.6,
   "dur": 4.23,
   "end": 246.83,
   "section": "L7 YEAR 30, MIDPOINT RUG PULL",
   "rate": 156
  },
  {
   "id": "m5",
   "text": "At eighteen, there weren't enough jobs. But at thirty, every senior job on the planet is suddenly yours.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 246.95,
   "dur": 6.92,
   "end": 253.88,
   "section": "L7 YEAR 30, MIDPOINT RUG PULL",
   "rate": 156
  },
  {
   "id": "m6",
   "text": "The most experienced surgeon alive is still finishing their training.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 254.0,
   "dur": 3.85,
   "end": 257.84,
   "section": "L7 YEAR 30, MIDPOINT RUG PULL",
   "rate": 156
  },
  {
   "id": "m7",
   "text": "Every judge, every pilot, every power-station engineer: thirty. Same as you.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 257.96,
   "dur": 4.23,
   "end": 262.19,
   "section": "L7 YEAR 30, MIDPOINT RUG PULL",
   "rate": 156
  },
  {
   "id": "m8",
   "text": "Your kids will never meet a grandparent. And nobody is left to ask how anything used to work.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 262.31,
   "dur": 6.92,
   "end": 269.24,
   "section": "L7 YEAR 30, MIDPOINT RUG PULL",
   "rate": 156
  },
  {
   "id": "r65a",
   "text": "Year sixty-five. The retirement promise comes due.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 269.66,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "end": 272.22,
   "section": "L8 YEAR 65, TRAILER PAID",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "r65b",
   "text": "On one Monday, over six billion of you stop working, and every pension on Earth starts paying at once.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 272.34,
   "dur": 6.95,
   "end": 279.29,
   "section": "L8 YEAR 65, TRAILER PAID",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "r65c",
   "text": "Here's the catch: who does the work? Your kids, the echo, now twenty to forty-five.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 279.41,
   "dur": 5.49,
   "end": 284.9,
   "section": "L8 YEAR 65, TRAILER PAID",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "r65d",
   "text": "Japan, the oldest big country today, has about one retiree for every two working-age adults. You have three for every four.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 285.02,
   "dur": 7.68,
   "end": 292.7,
   "section": "L8 YEAR 65, TRAILER PAID",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "r65e",
   "text": "Every golf course on Earth is booked solid.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 292.82,
   "dur": 2.93,
   "end": 295.75,
   "section": "L8 YEAR 65, TRAILER PAID",
   "rate": 164
  },
  {
   "id": "r80a",
   "text": "Then come the hard years.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 296.17,
   "dur": 2.03,
   "end": 298.19,
   "section": "L8b YEAR 80, LOW POINT",
   "rate": 148
  },
  {
   "id": "r80b",
   "text": "Year eighty. Half of you are gone.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 298.31,
   "dur": 2.84,
   "end": 301.15,
   "section": "L8b YEAR 80, LOW POINT",
   "rate": 148
  },
  {
   "id": "r80c",
   "text": "The world holds four times today's funerals, and nearly every one is for someone your age.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 301.27,
   "dur": 6.49,
   "end": 307.76,
   "section": "L8b YEAR 80, LOW POINT",
   "rate": 148
  },
  {
   "id": "r80d",
   "text": "Your friends. Your partner. Half of that ninety-kid classroom.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 307.88,
   "dur": 3.65,
   "end": 311.53,
   "section": "L8b YEAR 80, LOW POINT",
   "rate": 148
  },
  {
   "id": "r80e",
   "text": "Was sharing every birthday worth it? Or did it just mean losing everyone together?",
   "os": null,
   "start": 311.65,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "end": 317.32,
   "section": "L8b YEAR 80, LOW POINT",
   "rate": 148
  },
  {
   "id": "rv1",
   "text": "But look at the chart again.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 318.14,
   "dur": 2.25,
   "end": 320.39,
   "section": "L8c REVERSAL",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "rv2",
   "text": "Under your shrinking bar sits the echo, and under that, the echo's echo, lower and wider.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 320.51,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "end": 326.51,
   "section": "L8c REVERSAL",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "rv3",
   "text": "Japan already showed you how this ends.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 326.63,
   "dur": 2.62,
   "end": 329.26,
   "section": "L8c REVERSAL",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "rv4",
   "text": "Its first boom peaked at two point seven million babies in nineteen forty-nine.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 329.38,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "end": 334.25,
   "section": "L8c REVERSAL",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "rv5",
   "text": "The echo, in nineteen seventy-three, peaked at two point one million, spread across more years.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 334.37,
   "dur": 5.62,
   "end": 340.0,
   "section": "L8c REVERSAL",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "rv6",
   "text": "But the third wave everyone expected around two thousand? It never really showed up.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 340.12,
   "dur": 5.25,
   "end": 345.37,
   "section": "L8c REVERSAL",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "rv8",
   "text": "Your birthday put eight billion babies into one day. The echo's busiest day has about one and a half million.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 345.49,
   "dur": 7.5,
   "end": 352.99,
   "section": "L8c REVERSAL",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "rv9",
   "text": "By the time you're a hundred, your family has birthdays in every month.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 353.11,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "end": 357.98,
   "section": "L8c REVERSAL",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "c1",
   "text": "Year one hundred.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 358.4,
   "dur": 1.12,
   "end": 359.53,
   "section": "L9 YEARS 100-110, CLIMB",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "c2",
   "text": "Roughly forty million of you are still here, more than fifty times today's centenarians.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 359.65,
   "dur": 5.25,
   "end": 364.9,
   "section": "L9 YEARS 100-110, CLIMB",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "c3",
   "text": "But past a hundred and five, each birthday is a coin toss.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 365.02,
   "dur": 4.5,
   "end": 369.52,
   "section": "L9 YEARS 100-110, CLIMB",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "c4",
   "text": "A twenty eighteen study of Italy's oldest people found about half die before their next birthday, every year.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 369.64,
   "dur": 6.75,
   "end": 376.39,
   "section": "L9 YEARS 100-110, CLIMB",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "c5",
   "text": "From here on, this is less a forecast and more a dice roll.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 376.51,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "end": 381.38,
   "section": "L9 YEARS 100-110, CLIMB",
   "rate": 160
  },
  {
   "id": "c6",
   "text": "At a hundred and ten, forty thousand of you.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 381.8,
   "dur": 3.51,
   "end": 385.31,
   "section": "L9c YEAR 110, HALVING LADDER",
   "rate": 154
  },
  {
   "id": "c7",
   "text": "Twenty thousand at a hundred and eleven. Then ten thousand. Five thousand.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 385.43,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "end": 390.1,
   "section": "L9c YEAR 110, HALVING LADDER",
   "rate": 154
  },
  {
   "id": "c8",
   "text": "By a hundred and twenty, a few dozen of you.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 390.22,
   "dur": 3.9,
   "end": 394.12,
   "section": "L9c YEAR 110, HALVING LADDER",
   "rate": 154
  },
  {
   "id": "c9",
   "text": "The longest life on record is Jeanne Calment's: a hundred and twenty-two years and five months.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 394.24,
   "dur": 6.23,
   "end": 400.47,
   "section": "L9c YEAR 110, HALVING LADDER",
   "rate": 154
  },
  {
   "id": "c10",
   "text": "With that many people rolling the same dice, one of you very likely beats her.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 400.59,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "end": 406.44,
   "section": "L9c YEAR 110, HALVING LADDER",
   "rate": 154
  },
  {
   "id": "p1",
   "text": "Year one hundred and twenty-five. One of you is left.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 407.46,
   "dur": 4.05,
   "end": 411.51,
   "section": "L9d YEAR 125, MASTER PAYOFF + SECOND STAGE",
   "rate": 148
  },
  {
   "id": "p2",
   "text": "And here's the birthday none of the others ever had.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 411.63,
   "dur": 4.05,
   "end": 415.69,
   "section": "L9d YEAR 125, MASTER PAYOFF + SECOND STAGE",
   "rate": 148
  },
  {
   "id": "p3",
   "text": "For the first time in their life, nobody else on Earth is turning the same age.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 415.81,
   "dur": 6.49,
   "end": 422.29,
   "section": "L9d YEAR 125, MASTER PAYOFF + SECOND STAGE",
   "rate": 148
  },
  {
   "id": "p4",
   "text": "Eight billion birthdays, down to one.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 422.41,
   "dur": 2.43,
   "end": 424.84,
   "section": "L9d YEAR 125, MASTER PAYOFF + SECOND STAGE",
   "rate": 148
  },
  {
   "id": "p5",
   "text": "But that isn't the strangest part. Look who's at the table.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 424.96,
   "dur": 4.46,
   "end": 429.42,
   "section": "L9d YEAR 125, MASTER PAYOFF + SECOND STAGE",
   "rate": 148
  },
  {
   "id": "p6",
   "text": "Grandkids. Great-great-grandkids. Every one of them born on a different day.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 429.54,
   "dur": 4.46,
   "end": 434.0,
   "section": "L9d YEAR 125, MASTER PAYOFF + SECOND STAGE",
   "rate": 148
  },
  {
   "id": "p7",
   "text": "And outside, the counter from the very first second is back to normal: about four babies a second.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 434.12,
   "dur": 7.3,
   "end": 441.42,
   "section": "L9d YEAR 125, MASTER PAYOFF + SECOND STAGE",
   "rate": 148
  },
  {
   "id": "b1",
   "text": "Go back to that first morning.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 442.24,
   "dur": 2.37,
   "end": 444.61,
   "section": "L10 BOOKEND + RECAP + THESIS",
   "rate": 152
  },
  {
   "id": "b2",
   "text": "Sixty years of births before lunch. Ninety kids to a class. Every job handed over in a day. One last candle.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 444.73,
   "dur": 8.29,
   "end": 453.02,
   "section": "L10 BOOKEND + RECAP + THESIS",
   "rate": 152
  },
  {
   "id": "b3",
   "text": "All of it came from removing one thing: the gaps between us.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 453.14,
   "dur": 4.74,
   "end": 457.88,
   "section": "L10 BOOKEND + RECAP + THESIS",
   "rate": 152
  },
  {
   "id": "b4",
   "text": "But in the real world, somebody is always a few steps ahead of you.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 458.0,
   "dur": 5.53,
   "end": 463.52,
   "section": "L10 BOOKEND + RECAP + THESIS",
   "rate": 152
  },
  {
   "id": "b5",
   "text": "Someone holding your hand while you learned to walk. Someone teaching ninety kids. Someone handing over the keys.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 463.64,
   "dur": 7.11,
   "end": 470.75,
   "section": "L10 BOOKEND + RECAP + THESIS",
   "rate": 152
  },
  {
   "id": "b6",
   "text": "A population pyramid isn't really a chart. It's a relay race, and it only works if somebody is right behind you.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 470.87,
   "dur": 8.29,
   "end": 479.16,
   "section": "L10 BOOKEND + RECAP + THESIS",
   "rate": 152
  },
  {
   "id": "cta1",
   "text": "So, would you rather be one of the eight billion, sharing your birthday with the whole planet?",
   "os": null,
   "start": 479.58,
   "dur": 6.54,
   "end": 486.12,
   "section": "L11 CTA",
   "rate": 156
  },
  {
   "id": "cta2",
   "text": "Or one of their kids, born into a world where every grown-up is exactly the same age? Tell me below.",
   "os": null,
   "start": 486.24,
   "dur": 7.69,
   "end": 493.93,
   "section": "L11 CTA",
   "rate": 156
  }
 ],
